{'symbol': 'ORLY', 'date': '2022-04-27 16:30:00', 'title': "O'REILLY AUTOMOTIVE, INC. REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2022 RESULTS", 'text': "SPRINGFIELD, MO., APRIL 27, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- O'REILLY AUTOMOTIVE, INC. (THE “COMPANY” OR “O'REILLY”) ( NASDAQ: ORLY), A LEADING RETAILER IN THE AUTOMOTIVE AFTERMARKET INDUSTRY, TODAY ANNOUNCED RECORD REVENUE FOR ITS FIRST QUARTER ENDED MARCH\xa031,\xa02022, AND ANNOUNCED THE TRANSITION PLAN FOR TOM MCFALL, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CFO."}